    {
      "id": "claim_acdd08532d4f43129105afa760630b6c",
      "statement": "When `account.net_deposits` is set, `AccountHoldingsRead.total_profit_loss` is overridden to `total_value - net_deposits` with the percentage reported only when deposits are non-zero; this cash-flow P&L is a distinct quantity from the per-holding `profit_loss` (value minus cost basis) and from `AccountTotals.cost`.",
