      "statement": "`src/account/csv/parser.py` parses quantities and book values as `Decimal` after stripping `,` and `$`, and computes `average_cost` as `(book_value / quantity).quantize(Decimal(\"0.0001\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP)`, returning `None` for non-positive quantity or missing book value.",
