      "statement": "`get_holdings_by_security` computes `account_percentage` from `MarketPricesApi.get_latest_close` multiplied by quantity, rounded to 2 places, converted to the account currency, then divided by `get_total_for_account(...).value.amount`, so numerator and denominator are both in account currency only because the holding value is converted first.",
